  "summary": [
    {
      "text": "ENS is an Ethereum naming system that maps readable names to addresses and other identifiers.",
      "lines": ["L1", "L2"],
      "paragraph": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "People can register and manage names through the ENS App.",
      "lines": ["L6"],
      "paragraph": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The current registrar accepts USDC and DAI, and the price depends on the selected name and duration.",
      "lines": ["L7", "L9"],
      "paragraph": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "ENS says its DAO governs the protocol and treasury using the ENS governance token.",
      "lines": ["L10", "L12"],
      "paragraph": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "The Registry root leads to a contract owned by the ENS DAO Wallet.",
